2026-07-26T10:43:09.5401429Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5401946Z i /tmp/RtmpR0qlQ8/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5402292Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5403126Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5403495Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5404067Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5404851Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5405515Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5574981Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5653999Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:43:09.5914593Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:43:09.6007045Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
